| --- | ---: |
| Post-burn-in acceptance | 0.9900 |
| Sample mean X | 0.01151 |
| Sample mean Y | -0.00963 |
| Split R-hat for X | 1.0044 |
| Split R-hat for Y | 1.0054 |
